{"unit_id":"tag:04R5:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）的芽（germ）。<MATH_0002>在<MATH_0003>处的维数（dimension）是<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>中的开邻域（open neighbourhoods）的维数（dimensions）的最小值（minimum），且任意足够小（small）的开邻域（open neighbourhood）都具有这一维数（dimension）。因此，这是该芽（germ）的同构（isomorphism）类（class）的不变量（invariant）。我们将其简单地记为<MATH_0006>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"germ","target_term":"芽"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhoods","target_term":"开邻域"},{"source_term":"dimensions","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"minimum","target_term":"最小值"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhood","target_term":"开邻域"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"germ","target_term":"芽"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变量"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"给定芽的概形，待决。"},{"source_term":"germ","target_term":"芽","context":"概形的芽，待决。"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"点处的维数，待决。"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhoods","target_term":"开邻域","context":"点的开邻域，待决。"},{"source_term":"dimensions","target_term":"维数","context":"各开邻域的维数，待决。"},{"source_term":"minimum","target_term":"最小值","context":"开邻域维数的最小值，待决。"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"足够小的开邻域，按现行来源目录记录，待决。"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhood","target_term":"开邻域","context":"足够小的开邻域，待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"芽的同构，待决。"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"芽的同构类，待决。"},{"source_term":"invariant","target_term":"不变量","context":"同构类的不变量，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04NL:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>。芽（germs）的态射（morphisms）的性质<MATH_0002>是在源与目标上平展局部（<ACCENT_0001>tale local on the source-and-target）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"germs","target_term":"芽"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale local on the source-and-target","target_term":"在源与目标上平展局部"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"germs","target_term":"芽","context":"概形的芽，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"芽之间的态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"étale local on the source-and-target","target_term":"在源与目标上平展局部","context":"芽态射性质的局部性，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04NL:proof","translation":"给定定义<REF_0001>中的图（diagram），我们得到纤维（fibres）之间的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，它将<MATH_0002>映到<MATH_0003>，见引理<REF_0002>。于是等式（equality）<MATH_0004>由引理<REF_0003>得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equality","target_term":"等式"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"定义中的图，待决。"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"基变换的纤维，待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"纤维间态射的性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"纤维间的态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"equality","target_term":"等式","context":"点处维数的等式，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
