{"unit_id":"tag:023U:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节的大部分论证是形式性的，仅依赖于下降（descent）数据（datum）的定义。在《单纯空间（Simplicial Spaces）》第<REF_0001>节，我们将考察它与单纯（simplicial）概形（schemes）的关系，这会使情形更清楚一些。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"Simplicial Spaces","target_term":"单纯空间"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据，待决。"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据","context":"一份下降数据，待决。"},{"source_term":"Simplicial Spaces","target_term":"单纯空间","context":"引用章名，待决。"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯","context":"单纯概形，待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"单纯概形，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023V:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的概形（scheme）。一份<TEXTITOPEN_0001>用于<MATH_0004>的下降数据（descent datum for）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0005>，它是<MATH_0006>上的概形（schemes）之间的同构，并满足<TEXTITOPEN_0002>上循环条件（cocycle condition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，即图（diagram）<MATH_0007>交换（commutes）（采用显然的记号）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 我们也称这一对（pair）<MATH_0008>为一份<TEXTITOPEN_0003>相对于<MATH_0009>的下降数据（descent datum relative）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>。\n<STRUCT_0004> 一个<TEXTITOPEN_0004>态射（morphism）<MATH_0010>，它是相对于<MATH_0011>的下降数据之间的（of descent data relative）态射<TEXTITCLOSE_0004>，是一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>，它是<MATH_0013>上的概形（schemes）的态射，并使图（diagram）<MATH_0014>交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"descent datum for","target_term":"下降数据"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上循环条件"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对"},{"source_term":"descent datum relative","target_term":"下降数据"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"of descent data relative","target_term":"下降数据之间的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"概形间态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"概形及下降数据的态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"相对概形，待决。"},{"source_term":"descent datum for","target_term":"下降数据","context":"所给相对概形的下降数据，待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"下降数据的同构，待决。"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上循环条件","context":"下降数据的相容性条件，待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"下降定义的图，待决。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"图交换，待决。"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对","context":"概形与同构组成的对，待决。"},{"source_term":"descent datum relative","target_term":"下降数据","context":"相对于所给态射的下降数据，待决。"},{"source_term":"of descent data relative","target_term":"下降数据之间的","context":"相对下降数据间态射，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023U:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n上面的定义会产生各种“神奇”的恒等式（identities）。例如，<MATH_0001>沿对角（diagonal）态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>的拉回（pullback）可以看作态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。这是因为<MATH_0004>，并且还有<MATH_0005>。事实上，<MATH_0006>等于恒等（identity）。如果你对这些内容不熟悉，这是一个很好的练习。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"identities","target_term":"恒等式"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"identities","target_term":"恒等式","context":"下降定义产生的恒等式，待决。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角","context":"对角态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"对角态射及拉回态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"拉回","context":"沿对角态射的拉回，待决。"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等","context":"恒等态射，待决。"}],"notes":["remark：来源字面为 This because，疑似漏词；保留其因果含义及全部公式，不修复英文来源。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02VP:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>为相对于<MATH_0003>的下降（descent）数据（datum）。我们可以将同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0004>视为同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0005>，它是<MATH_0006>上的概形（schemes）之间的同构。因此，粗略地说，可以将<MATH_0007>视为映射（map）<MATH_0008><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>遗憾的是，这里我们为箭头（arrow）选择了“错误”的方向。在定义<REF_0001>及<REF_0002>中，应取与定义<REF_0003>中所取方向相反的方向，这是由“函数（functions）”与“空间（spaces）”对偶（dual）的一般原理决定的。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。上循环条件（cocycle condition）于是表示<MATH_0009>。这样，它与拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）上的下降（descent）数据（datum）的情形非常相似。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"functions","target_term":"函数"},{"source_term":"spaces","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"dual","target_term":"对偶"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上循环条件"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"相对概形，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"概形间态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据，待决。"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据","context":"相对概形及拟凝聚层的下降数据，两次出现，待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"下降数据的同构，待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"拉回表示的映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头","context":"脚注中的方向选择，待决。"},{"source_term":"functions","target_term":"函数","context":"脚注中的函数与空间对偶，待决。"},{"source_term":"spaces","target_term":"空间","context":"脚注中的函数与空间对偶，待决。"},{"source_term":"dual","target_term":"对偶","context":"脚注的一般原理，待决。"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上循环条件","context":"下降数据的相容性，待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"类比的下降数据，待决。"}],"notes":["remark：原脚注明确指出箭头方向的选择问题；忠实保留脚注与全部公式，未调整箭头方向。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023U:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下面给出目标（target）固定的态射族（family of morphisms）情形下的定义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标","context":"态射族的共同目标，待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"同一目标上的态射族，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023W:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为目标（target）是<MATH_0003>的态射族（family of morphisms）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 一份<TEXTITOPEN_0001>下降数据（descent datum）<MATH_0004>，它相对于族（relative to the family）<MATH_0005><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，由以下内容给出：概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>，它在<MATH_0007>上，对每个<MATH_0008>各有一个；同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0009>，它是<MATH_0010>上的概形（schemes）之间的同构，对每一对（pair）<MATH_0011>各有一个；并且对于每个指标（indices）三元组（triple）<MATH_0012>，图（diagram）<MATH_0013>作为<MATH_0014>上的概形（schemes）的图交换（commutes）（采用显然的记号）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 一个<TEXTITOPEN_0002>态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>，它是下降数据之间的（of descent data）态射<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，由一个族（family）<MATH_0016>给出，这是<MATH_0017>-概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0018>组成的族，并且所有图（diagrams）<MATH_0019>交换（commute）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"descent datum","target_term":"下降数据"},{"source_term":"relative to the family","target_term":"相对于族"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对"},{"source_term":"indices","target_term":"指标"},{"source_term":"triple","target_term":"三元组"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"of descent data","target_term":"下降数据之间的"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"相对概形及其基概形，待决。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标","context":"态射族的共同目标，待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"所给态射族，待决。"},{"source_term":"descent datum","target_term":"下降数据","context":"相对于态射族的下降数据，待决。"},{"source_term":"relative to the family","target_term":"相对于族","context":"下降数据的相对范围，待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"下降数据的同构，待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"基上的概形，待决。"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对","context":"指标对，待决。"},{"source_term":"indices","target_term":"指标","context":"指标三元组，待决。"},{"source_term":"triple","target_term":"三元组","context":"指标三元组，待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"上循环条件的图，待决。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"上循环条件的图交换，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"下降数据间的态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"of descent data","target_term":"下降数据之间的","context":"下降数据间态射的限定，待决。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"分量态射构成的族，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"分量态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图","context":"下降态射的图，待决。"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换","context":"下降态射的图交换，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023U:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n例如，当问到相对曲线（relative curves）的纤维化范畴（fibred category）是否是 fpqc 拓扑（fpqc topology）中的栈（stack）时，这一概念便自然出现（它并不是，至少在只限于概形（schemes）时并不是）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"relative curves","target_term":"相对曲线"},{"source_term":"fibred category","target_term":"纤维化范畴"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"栈"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"relative curves","target_term":"相对曲线","context":"相对曲线的范畴，待决。"},{"source_term":"fibred category","target_term":"纤维化范畴","context":"相对曲线的纤维化范畴，待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑","context":"栈条件所用拓扑，待决。"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"栈","context":"相对曲线范畴的栈条件，待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"只限于概形的范围，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:02VQ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为目标（target）是<MATH_0003>的态射族（family of morphisms）。设<MATH_0004>为相对于<MATH_0005>的下降（descent）数据（datum）。我们可以将同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0006>视为同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0007>，它们是<MATH_0008>上的概形（schemes）之间的同构。因此，粗略地说，可以将<MATH_0009>视为同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0010>，它在<MATH_0011>上。上循环条件（cocycle condition）于是表示<MATH_0012>。这样，它与拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）上的下降（descent）数据（datum）的情形非常相似。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上循环条件"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形，待决。"},{"source_term":"target","target_term":"目标","context":"态射族的共同目标，待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"所给态射族，待决。"},{"source_term":"descent","target_term":"下降","context":"下降数据，待决。"},{"source_term":"datum","target_term":"数据","context":"相对概形及拟凝聚层的下降数据，两次出现，待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"下降数据中的同构，待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"基上的概形，待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"拉回表示中的同构，待决。"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"上循环条件","context":"下降数据的相容性，待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"类比的下降数据，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:023U:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们通常采用由单个态射（morphism）构成的族（family）这一版本，原因在于下面的引理。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"族中的唯一态射，待决。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"单个态射构成的族，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
